{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"陈联络"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“陈联络”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>陈联络在 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kähler流形","text":"Kähler 流形"}},{"Plain":"上尤其重要.</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>. 设 $(E,h)$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hermite向量丛","text":"Hermite 向量丛"}},{"Plain":", 其上的<strong>陈联络</strong>是指满足 $\\nabla h =0$, $(\\nabla^{0,1})^2=0$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"联络","text":"联络"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对任意"},{"Local":{"url":"全纯向量丛","text":"全纯向量丛"}},{"Plain":" $(E,\\bar\\partial_E)$, 给定其上的 Hermite 结构 $h$, 存在唯一的陈联络 $\\nabla$ 满足 $\\nabla^{0,1}=\\bar\\partial_E$.</p>\n<p>$\\nabla h=0$ 等价于对 $E$ 的<strong>光滑截面</strong> $s,t$,\n$$\r\nd(h(\\bar s,t)) = h(\\overline{\\nabla s},t)+ h(\\bar s,\\nabla t),\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对于全纯向量丛 $E$ 上的 Hermite 结构 $h$, 陈联络的联络形式为\n$$\r\n\\omega = h^{-1} \\partial h = (h^{i \\bar k}\\partial h_{\\bar k j}).\r\n$$\n<strong>证明</strong>. 回忆联络形式 $\\omega^i_j$ 的定义为\n$$\r\n\\nabla e_j = e_i \\otimes \\omega^i_j,\r\n$$\n其中 $\\omega^i_j$ 是 $(1,0)$-形式. 则\n$$\r\n\\underbrace{\\partial h_{\\bar i j}}+ \\bar\\partial h_{\\bar i j} = dh_{\\bar i j}=h_{\\bar k j}\\overline{\\omega^k_i}+ \\underbrace{h_{\\bar i k}\\omega^k_j}.\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\omega^i_{j}=h^{i \\bar k}\\partial h_{\\bar k j},\\quad \\omega = h^{-1}\\partial h.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>曲率</h2>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 带有 Hermite 结构的全纯向量丛上的陈联络的"},{"Local":{"url":"曲率","text":"曲率"}},{"Plain":"是一个 $(1,1)$-形式\n$$\r\n\\Omega = \\bar\\partial (h^{-1}\\partial h)= \\bar\\partial\\omega.\r\n$$\n<strong>证明</strong>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\t\\Omega &amp;= d\\omega + \\omega\\wedge\\omega\\\\\r\n\t&amp;= (\\partial+\\bar\\partial)(h^{-1}\\partial h) +h^{-1}\\partial h \\wedge h^{-1}\\partial h\\\\\r\n\t&amp;=\\cdots = \\bar\\partial (h^{-1}\\partial h).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<strong>定理</strong>. 设 $L\\to M$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"全纯线丛","text":"全纯线丛"}},{"Plain":", 则有 (不依赖于平凡化!)\n$$\r\n\\Omega = - \\partial \\bar\\partial \\log h.\r\n$$\n<strong>推论</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"全纯线丛","text":"全纯线丛"}},{"Plain":"的第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nc_1 = \\frac{i}{2\\pi}\\Omega = - \\frac{i}{2\\pi} \\partial \\bar\\partial  \\log h.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}